{"path":"regex/match_results/length","title":"std::match_results<BidirIt,Alloc>::length","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::match_results&lt;BidirIt,Alloc&gt;::</span>length","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/match_results/length","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the length of the specified sub-match.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">difference_type length<span class=\"br0\">(</span> size_type n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the length of the specified sub-match.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>, the length of the entire matched expression is returned.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, the length of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code><sup>th</sup> sub-match is returned.\n</p><p>if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;=</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, a length of the unmatched match is returned.\n</p><p>The call is equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>n<span class=\"br0\">]</span>.<span class=\"me1\">length</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results/ready\"><code>ready()</code></a> must be <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>. Otherwise, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> integral number specifying which match to examine\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The length of the specified match or sub-match.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results/operator_at\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator[]</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns specified sub-match <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/sub_match/length\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>length</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the length of the match (if any) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::sub_match&lt;BidirIt&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"regex","title":"Regular expressions library (since C++11)"},{"path":"regex/match_results","title":"std::match_results"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::match_results<BidirIt,Alloc>::length","children":[{"lab